# Copy to .env for local overrides. .env itself is gitignored, so a Vercel
# build falls back to VERCEL_PROJECT_PRODUCTION_URL and then to the default
# committed in vite.config.ts — see resolveSiteUrl() there.
#
# Every absolute URL the page advertises comes from this one value:
# canonical, og:url, og:image, the JSON-LD url, robots.txt's Sitemap line
# and sitemap.xml's <loc>.
#
# Set this to the real domain the day it goes live. Shipping a canonical for
# a domain this build is NOT served from tells search engines the real page
# lives elsewhere — that is the failure mode to avoid.
#
# No trailing slash.
VITE_SITE_URL=https://downsize-alpha.vercel.app
